    grammarRule:"Advanced discourse markers — particularly those for concession (That said, Admittedly, Even so), contrast (However, Nevertheless, Yet), and reformulation (To put it differently, In other words, What this means is) — allow speakers to present complex, nuanced arguments at C1+ level.",
